{"reviewId": "393022807_83OI74Bhh", "review": {"abstract": "在大周期格局下理解短期的价格波动才是研究康波价格的根本意义。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这才是人生财富靠康波的精髓。\n在以往看过的案例中，无论是中国A股市场长周期的牛熊，还是华尔街从20世纪之前开始的波动，亦或是我们最近的房地产周期等等，都能很明显的感觉到规律性的东西，并且如果时间和耐心允许，似乎我们每个人都可以在这些各种周期里面实现财富。但难点在于我们人生时间有限，我们也不是决策者，我们的见识和能力没有让我们参与长周期的机会。但是这些大的周期中是由一些小周期的规律性的东西构成的，就像是海边一波波涌来的海浪和其中小海浪以及小海浪里面的浪花，我们要做的就是找到这些小浪花，实现财富跃升。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "9542-9572", "createTime": 1760166115, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "393022807_83OI74Bhh", "userVid": 393022807, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 393022807, "name": "Majesty", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/aSUaVfbBYU8NFeuGdqM1yeyB18ogFYyNemos2pRia1SFsOcNpLxRAqqfH551jwcKAZnspl4gFFNK5PZQSia3j3IEDhWs1xwbkWGglXTluPK4Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240617-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 246, "likes": [{"userVid": 403857176, "name": "jessie", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Jp7LdHibIC3IAkQP0XPjNVibRJU2WCrh1KVPDu6dGogqB7GicQCa7WttiaP3deQcjf9pLnBwYuA5j0XL0v6lYHF4oQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepV